family Water Heater
category plumbing
host wall
ifc IfcElectricAppliance FREESTANDINGWATERHEATER
param Power number type 2000
param Volume number type 80
param FlowCold number type 0.1
param FlowHot number type 0.1
param Diameter length type 450mm
param Height length type 800mm
param Elevation length type 1200mm
param Casing material type "Enamel White"
ref Wall y = 0
ref Centre x = 0
type "80 l" Diameter=450mm, Height=800mm, Volume=80
type "150 l" Diameter=560mm, Height=1150mm, Elevation=900mm, Volume=150, FlowCold=0.2, FlowHot=0.2
type "20x40in" Diameter=20in, Height=40in, Elevation=40in, Volume=113
extrude Tank circle(Centre, Wall + Diameter / 2, Diameter / 2) z(Elevation, Elevation + Height) mat(Casing) show(3d, elev)
symbol circle(Centre, Wall + Diameter / 2, Diameter / 2)
symbol rect(Centre - Diameter / 2, Wall, Centre + Diameter / 2, Wall + Diameter) show(fine)
connector Cold pipe cold_water at(Centre - 60mm, Wall + Diameter / 2, Elevation) dir(0, 0, -1) size(15mm)
connector Hot pipe hot_water at(Centre + 60mm, Wall + Diameter / 2, Elevation) dir(0, 0, -1) size(15mm)
connector Power conduit power at(Centre, Wall, Elevation + Height / 2) dir(0, -1, 0) size(20mm)
